author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "verifyPmCliGrammar or the command-grammar gate reports a terminal_consolidation_owner finding when a consolidation row's owner is closed, canceled or missing and the command is not carried by the alias relocation table, with a negative-control fixture; config, profile, schema and init rows name pm-npr3; assurance and history-author-acknowledge rows name the open delivery task filed beside this issue; the contracts fixture is regenerated; The gate's negative control proves a stale-owner row fails upward in CI"
parent: pm-n7rr
risk: medium
confidence: high
severity: medium
expected_result: Every consolidation row names an open owner or is reclassified; the grammar verification reports a finding when a consolidation owner is terminal or unknown.
actual_result: "assurance, config, profile, schema name closed pm-6apl; history-author-acknowledge names closed pm-tqel; init names the epic instead of pm-npr3; no check reads owner status."
